# Atelier proposal development lock

The **Atelier** proposal (`residential_premium_luxe`, Investment Blueprint renderer) is **complete and locked for development** (verified 2026-08-12 — web + PDF).

## What "locked" means

- **Do NOT** modify Atelier proposal files when fixing or building **other** presets (Golden, Quantum, Ember, Horizon, Solstice, Legacy, Commercial, Premium Luxe Noir, etc.).
- **Do NOT** hide or disable other themes in the UI — users may still choose any template.
- **Only** edit Atelier when the user **explicitly** asks to change the Atelier proposal.

## Frozen paths (no edits unless user requests Atelier changes)

- `components/proposals/atelier/**`
- `components/proposals/_registry/adapters/premium-luxe-adapter.tsx`
- `public/assets/proposals/atelier-*.jpg` (cover, trust, closing, and other Atelier static images)

See also `lib/atelier-proposal-lock.ts` and `components/proposals/atelier/README.lock.md`.

## When working on other presets

- Scope diffs to that preset's blocks, CSS, and registry entries only.
- Do not refactor shared Atelier utilities or CSS for another theme's sake — duplicate or adapt in the other preset's folder if needed.
- Other presets may **read** Atelier patterns for inspiration; do not change Atelier pages/CSS to match them.
- **Premium Luxe Noir** (`residential_luxe_noir`) is separately locked — see `lib/luxe-noir-proposal-lock.ts`.

## Public route

Atelier renders at `preset_id === "residential_premium_luxe"` via `PremiumLuxeAdapter` → `AtelierRenderer` — keep that path stable.
